# DuckDB runtime artifacts (regenerated from decp_prod.parquet at startup)
**/decp.duckdb
**/decp.duckdb.tmp
**/decp.duckdb.lock
**/colibre.duckdb
**/colibre.duckdb.tmp
**/colibre.duckdb.lock
